WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:04.819
Numbers from eleven to nineteen are a ten and some more.

00:05.269 --> 00:10.772
Look at fourteen. First fill a ten frame. A full frame is ten.

00:11.222 --> 00:13.103
Then count four more.

00:13.553 --> 00:19.335
Ten and four more makes fourteen. So fourteen is one ten and four ones.

00:19.785 --> 00:26.681
Every teen number works this way. Fifteen is ten and five. Eighteen is ten and eight.

00:27.131 --> 00:33.609
Try one yourself. Seventeen is a ten and how many more? It is a ten and seven.
